
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>403 - Access Forbidden | LetsStudy Pro</title>
<meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow">

<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{
  margin:0;
  font-family:Arial,sans-serif;
  background:#f1f5f9;
  color:#0f172a;
  min-height:100vh;
  display:flex;
  align-items:center;
  justify-content:center;
  padding:20px;
}
.container{
  width:100%;
  max-width:600px;
  background:white;
  border-radius:20px;
  padding:45px 30px;
  text-align:center;
  box-shadow:0 10px 35px rgba(15,23,42,.08);
}
.logo{
  font-size:22px;
  font-weight:bold;
  color:#2563eb;
  margin-bottom:30px;
}
.code{
  font-size:100px;
  font-weight:800;
  color:#2563eb;
  line-height:1;
  margin:10px 0;
}
h1{font-size:27px;margin:20px 0 12px}
p{
  color:#64748b;
  line-height:1.7;
  font-size:15px;
}
.info{
  background:#eff6ff;
  border:1px solid #dbeafe;
  padding:15px;
  border-radius:10px;
  margin:25px 0;
  color:#1e40af;
  font-size:13px;
  line-height:1.6;
}
.buttons{
  display:flex;
  justify-content:center;
  flex-wrap:wrap;
  gap:12px;
  margin-top:25px;
}
a{
  text-decoration:none;
  padding:13px 20px;
  border-radius:9px;
  font-size:14px;
  font-weight:bold;
}
.home{background:#2563eb;color:white}
.back{background:#e2e8f0;color:#334155}
footer{
  margin-top:35px;
  font-size:12px;
  color:#94a3b8;
}
@media(max-width:480px){
  .container{padding:35px 20px}
  .code{font-size:75px}
  h1{font-size:23px}
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<div class="container">

  <div class="logo">LetsStudy Pro</div>

  <div class="code">403</div>

  <h1>Access Forbidden</h1>

  <p>
    Sorry, you don't have permission to access this page.
    The requested resource is restricted or requires
    additional authorization.
  </p>

  <div class="info">
    <strong>Why am I seeing this?</strong><br>
    Your account may not have the required permissions,
    or this resource may be restricted to authorized users.
  </div>

  <div class="buttons">
    <a href="/" class="home">Go to Homepage</a>
    <a href="javascript:history.back()" class="back">Go Back</a>
  </div>

  <footer>
    LetsStudy Pro · Learn. Build. Work. Grow.
  </footer>

</div>

</body>
</html>
